ions."},"wigs-home-reviews":[{"score":5,"goodsId":601099513663000,"comment":"This my first time ordering a wig from here & ilove ittt!!! It's soo soft and it doesn't shed, & it is the exact length i wanted. i am very satisfied Temuuuu🥰","name":"hudsonjada503","reviewTime":"yesterday","time":"Mar 31, 2023","picture":"https://aimg.kwcdn.com/upload_aimg/kuiper/b35dfb94-5dcf-4869-b563-7973527c36be.jpeg.slim.jpeg"},{"score":5,"goodsId":601099512509824,"comment":"Hair is great, the lace was great as well. If you use a wide tooth comb there shouldn't be any shedding because it is deep wave hair but overall I love this wig !!","name":"Minnie606","time":"Apr 10, 2023","picture":"https://aimg.kwcdn.com/upload_aimg/kuiper/d2650d8d-5da9-4765-8f64-a35dd323896e.jpeg.slim.jpeg"},{"score":5,"goodsId":6017592186095910,"comment":"GREAT quality & lace! highly recommend! knots bleached well!","name":"Kylahhh777","time":"Feb 23, 2023","picture":"https://aimg.kwcdn.com/upload_aimg/kuiper/368b2d0f-47a0-442a-ba06-470bc1740db2.jpeg.slim.jpeg"},{"score":5,"goodsId":601099514724567,"comment":"Definitely recommend getting this pretty nice soft wig😍😍. Comes in a really cute package I adored it so much🥰. I've had this installed for a week and a half now and it still looks good and the hair texture is still good.","name":"Jimena","reviewTime":"yesterday","time":"Dec 15, 2022","picture":"https://aimg.kwcdn.com/upload_aimg/kuiper/5189c277-e6a9-4cb1-986e-063989d289cb.jpeg.slim.jpeg"},{"score":5,"goodsId":601099513897763,"comment":"I love it😍😍 the quality, everything!!! can't wait to get it installed!!!","name":"Amy Gueye","time":"Jan 8, 2023","picture":"https://aimg.kwcdn.com/upload_aimg/kuiper/c922347b-de22-476e-b4d3-14b935ae8d6f.jpeg.slim.jpeg"},{"score":5,"goodsId":601099512729931,"comment":"Love the texture and the color and fit, it is just like the picture shows.Thank you so much!","name":"Kayunjanae","time":"Mar 15, 2023","picture":"https://aimg.kwcdn.com/upload_aimg/kuiper/266f6c84-7d55-4a63-