wnload Temu app and claim the coupon with the coupon code. The coupon applies to a single order only within the applicable product scope (if any) and cannot be combined with other offers. Order value over {{orderMinAmount}} is required. The discount is capped at {{amount}}. The coupon will expire at {{expireTime}} (local time) on the day after activating the code. <span>T&Cs apply.</span>","affiliate":{"left":"<Prefix>left</Prefix><TimePicker />","off":"OFF","auto_jump_app_timer":"({{time}}s)","sign_in_to_claim_countdown":"Sign in to Claim<time>({{sec}}s)</time>","get_and_use_now_countdown":"Get & use now <time>({{sec}}s)</time>"},"affiliate_rule_desc_text_v3":"You are entitled to receive a {{amount}} reward if (i) you join the Affiliate Program for the first time; and (ii) your Facebook group is reviewed and approved by Temu. The reward will be issued to your available balance and cannot be withdrawn unless your total earnings in the available balance exceed {{withdrawCash}}. You may withdraw the reward as cash via PayPal or other available methods displayed on the Affiliate Program page, or redeem it as Temu Credits. Temu Credits cannot be redeemed for cash. Check the details on the program page and Temu Affiliate Policy.","cps-retain-popup":{"dont-miss-best-prize":"Don’t let the benefit get away!","dont-miss-coupon":"Don’t let the coupon bundle get away!","give-up":"Give Up","shop-now":"Shop Now","save-now":"Save Now","sign-in-to-claim":"Sign in to Claim","expire-in":"<Prefix>Expire in</Prefix><TimePicker />","cart-can-save":"Your cart is eligible to <span> Save {{money}}</span>","pick-more-to-save":"Pick {{amount}} more to <span> Save {{money}}</span>"},"noChannelGoodsQAReasn":{"CART_EXIST_GOODS":"One Shopping cart can only add one item with the 'Exclusive Deal' price. You can still add it at a discounted price.","NO_CHANNEL_PRICE":"Sorry, Items at Exclusive Deal prices are sold out. You can still buy it at a discounted price.","USER_NO_QA":"Only new App users can purchase 'Exclusive Deal' products. You can still buy it at a discounted price.","GOODS_SOLD_OUT":"Sorry, Items at Exclusive Deal prices are sold out. You can still buy it at a discounted price."},"channel-goods-v2":{"limit-title":"Only new app user can purchase<bold></bold>","native-limit-title":"A new App user can only purchase <bold>one Exclusive Deal item</bold>","flash-sale":"Exclusive Deal","best_price":"Best Price","off":"<bold>{{discount}}</bold>%OFF","off-two":"-{{discount}}%","selling-fast":"Selling fast","download-dialog-title":"Download Temu app to get your exclusive best price!","get-now":"Get Now","limit-toast":"A new App user can only purchase one Exclusive Deal item","limit-toast-two":"Sorry,only new App users can purchase 'Exclusive Deal' products.","reason":"Only new app users can purchase 'Exclusive Deal' products. But you can still buy it at a discounted price."}},"affiliate_rule_short":{"download_app_claim_coupon_off_eea":"Download Temu app via this ad and claim a {{amount}} coupon bundle and a {{discount}} off coupon in the app within {{hours}} hours of downloading the Temu app for the first time.","discount_coupon_item_v2_eea":"The {{discount}} off coupon is applicable to an order over {{minAmount}}, and capped at {{maxAmount}}","coupon_bundle_includes_v1":"The {{amount}} coupon bundle includes multiple coupons: {{coupons}}.","t_c_apply":"T&Cs apply.","coupon_bundle_sum_total_value":"The total value of the coupon bundle as displayed is the sum of the potential savings you can realize if you use all of the Temu Coupons in this coupon bundle.","only_one_coupon_per_order_v2":"Only one coupon can be used per order unless otherwise stated.","offer_available_once_per_user":"This offer is available once per user.","coupon_item_valid_hours":"The coupon is valid for {{hours}} hours after receipt.","find_more_rules_coupons_offers_qa":"Find more rules regarding Temu Coupons in \"Coupons & Offers\"  →  \"Q&A.\"","see_official_rules":"See official rules