ng>","train_pcc_complete":"After you complete the application process, you can view your PCC on the final page. Copy the PCC and return to TEMU to fill it in directly. <strong>Please enter the name and phone as registered with the Korea Customs Service.</strong>","train_pcc_example":"For example, cell phone number verification process: Enter your phone number and click ‘전송’ to receive an authentication code. <strong>After entering the code, click ‘확인’ to complete the verification.</strong>","clearancePopup_MXrfcirinfo":"If you haven't officially registered with the SAT, the RFC displayed may be a temporary or generic one (e.g., XAXX010101000). Please ensure you provide your official and accurate RFC as registered with SAT. If the information doesn't match, your order could be held at customs."},"web-transaction.web-payment-list":{"learnMoreAboutTemuPurchaseProtection":"Learn more about Temu purchase protection","learnMoreAboutDeliveryGuarantee":"Learn more about delivery guarantee","learnMoreAboutSecurePrivacy":"Learn more about Secure privacy","viewAllPaymentMethods":"View all payment methods","viewMoreAboutCreditCardInstallmentPlans":"View more about credit card installment plans","openInNewTab":"Open in new tab.","paymentMethod":"Payment method","sepa_reauth_submit_btn":"Order and Pay {0}","sepa_reauth_title":"Fill in your SEPA account information stored on TEMU","save_account_retention":"Details will need to be filled in again if you leave now, continue adding your account.","add_your_bank":"Add your bank account","add_new_bank":"Add a new bank account","NO":"No","Yes":"Yes","iban":"IBAN","name_on_account":"Name on account","remember_account_tip":"We recommend saving your account details to avoid entering them each time. This is entirely up to you. Your personal data is securely encrypted.","remember_account":"Remember this account for future use","iban_length_invalid":"The IBAN account number length is invalid.","name_required":"The name is required.","selectio